TREATMENT PROVIDED
Emergency Services:     ${claim['CLAIM_AMOUNT'] * 0.25:,.2f}
Diagnostic Imaging:     ${claim['CLAIM_AMOUNT'] * 0.20:,.2f}
{'Surgical Procedures' if claim['CLAIM_TYPE'] == 'Health' else 'Physical Therapy'}:      ${claim['CLAIM_AMOUNT'] * 0.30:,.2f}
